            "en": "The exact first figurative use of like oil and water has not been securely identified. It is therefore safest to understand the idiom as a gradual metaphorical development from this familiar physical observation. Speakers began applying the image to people, ideas, personalities and styles that remained separate and could not work successfully together.",
