        "memoryEn": "A bitter pill hurts the mouth but still has to be swallowed; a bitter reality hurts emotionally but still has to be accepted.",
        "memoryZh": "苦藥令人難受，卻仍要吞下；苦澀的現實令人痛苦，卻仍要接受。"
