          "titleEn": "It Describes a Supportive Relationship Compactly",
          "titleZh": "簡潔描述互相支持的關係",
          "en": "Her brother was always a shoulder to cry on.",
          "zh": "較短的慣用語版本可以同時表達聆聽、同情、安慰和可靠的支持。",
          "examples": []
