            "en": "Cold turkey was used before it became strongly connected with stopping addictive substances. Merriam-Webster reports an example from 1910 in which cold turkey meant doing something outright, while a 1920 newspaper cartoon used it in the sense of speaking plainly. A drug-withdrawal use is documented by 1921.",
