          "titleZh": "意思比 make a mistake 更豐富",
          "en": "The idiomatic version suggests that the mistake was foolish, embarrassing and damaging.",
          "zh": "慣用語版本不只表示「犯錯」，還暗示這個錯誤愚蠢、令人尷尬，而且帶來麻煩。",
