          "number": 1,
          "titleEn": "It Connects a Risk with a Decision",
          "titleZh": "把風險與決定連繫起來",
          "en": "The idiomatic version highlights that the earlier train was a deliberate low-risk choice.",
          "zh": "使用慣用語的版本更能突出：乘搭較早的火車是一個有意作出的低風險選擇。",
