          "en": "The two companies fought for months over a major contract, and neither would give way. The two friends disagreed for five minutes about which film to watch. A brief everyday disagreement is normally too weak.",
          "zh": "兩間公司為一份重要合約爭持數月，雙方都不願讓步。 兩名朋友就觀看哪一套電影爭論了五分鐘。 短暫的日常意見分歧通常未達到這個表達所需的強度。",
