          "number": 2,
          "titleEn": "It Describes People and Arrangements",
          "titleZh": "同時適用於人和安排",
          "en": "It can therefore describe both confused people and badly organised situations.",
          "zh": "新員工全都無所適從。 活動計劃一片混亂。 因此，它既可以描述感到混亂的人，也可以描述組織欠佳的情況。",
