          "titleEn": "It Can Express Advice or Caution",
          "titleZh": "可以用來提出提醒",
          "en": "This warns somebody not to become emotionally committed too early. Model Examples Sophie wants the red bicycle more than anything else. Ethan has decided that becoming a pilot is the only career he truly wants. The course Alex wanted more than all the others was already full.",
